\section{Certification Findings and Conclusion}

\noindent
This technical audit was generated automatically by the \textbf{WindCtrl Validate} engine.
<% if summary.overall_status.value == "PASS" %>
The supervisory controller software demonstrated strict adherence to the aerodynamic, electrical, and structural safety criteria set forth by << config.standard >>. No emergency trip thresholds were exceeded, actuator rate demands remained within operational boundaries, and aerodynamic energy yield tracked within acceptable tolerance margins.
<% elif summary.overall_status.value == "WARNING" %>
The controller demonstrated nominal overall operation but flagged advisory warnings. Further investigation is recommended regarding control stability margins or pitch actuation latency prior to final site commissioning.
<% else %>
\textbf{NON-COMPLIANCE NOTICE:} Critical control rule violations or protective trip thresholds were detected during this test sequence. The supervisory controller failed validation checks. Release to production or field turbine deployment is \textbf{REJECTED} pending root-cause investigation.
<% endif %>

